OL,3,GNEWSAResidents return to their homes
OL,4,Aafter security alert
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents have returned to their homes
OL,7,Fafter a security alert in Lurgan.
OL,9,FA modified firework was found on James
OL,10,FStreet which could have caused
OL,11,Fsignificant damage or injury, police
OL,12,Fhave said.
OL,14,FPolice received a report at about 10:30
OL,15,FBST on Monday that a window had been
OL,16,Fsmashed at a home and a suspicious
OL,17,Fobject was found in the front garden by
OL,18,Fthe resident.
OL,20,FThe street, which was closed to traffic
OL,21,Fand pedestrians, has since been
OL,22,Freopened.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
